      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "AFAIK, the VRChat team has wanted to redo the trust ranking system for quite a while now, it's just been put on the backburner while other things take priority. There used to be a Veteran rank as well as a Legendary rank, but those didn't serve any special purpose in regards to trust ranking and were therefore removed. Perhaps if they do revise the trust ranking system, they'll use a different naming style than Known/Trusted.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
