      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree. It's VERY misleading. Most of trolls I have seen were either visitors or \"Trusted\" people (and the latter ones were usually far more problematic as they are more aware of how far they can push things).\n\nI think it should be either renamed or get removed entirely. And custom shaders should be off by default for all non-friends.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
