  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-08T20:33:59.215Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "What the title says.\n\nI have the feeling that \"Trusted\" is a to strong word just for a rank that literally everyone can get.\n\nThe first thing that came in my mind is \"Veteran\" or something like that. That sounds more like, that this person plays this game a ton and have alot of knowledge about VRChat.\n\nTrusted sounds more like...that this person is a trustworthy person that would never do something evil or is very kind to everyone. And we know...how some people are.",
